Page 135 orba: Found match for regex: {
Page 135 orba: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
Derived from {{cog|cs|-}} verb {{m|cs|orat||to plough}}, which is derived from {{der|cs|sla-pro|*orati}}, {{suffix|cs||-ba}}. This is related to {{cog|lt|árti}}, {{cog|got|𐌰𐍂𐌾𐌰𐌽}}, {{cog|gmh|erran}}, {{cog|la|arāre}} (all of them meaning "to plough"), {{cog|sga|airim||I plough}}, {{cog|grc|ἀρόω||I plough}}, {{cog|hy|արաւր||a plough}}, and {{cog|xto|-}} and {{cog|txb|-}} {{m|xto|āre||a plough}}. All of these come from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*h₂erh₃-||to plough}}.<ref name="Rejzek"/>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|orba|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|or|ba}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# [[ploughing]]
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2012|author=Vilém Kraus|title=Pěstujeme révu vinnou|publisher=Grada Publishing|location=Praha|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=TMV-b7k5OycC&pg=PA87#v=onepage&q&f=false|isbn=8024734656|page=87|passage=Pouhá '''orba''', kypření a odstraňování plevelů nemohou udržet půdu úrodnou.|translation=Soil cannot be kept fertile only by '''ploughing''', loosening and weed clearance.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="Rejzek">{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015|orat|475}}</ref>
</references>

