Page 562 rošáda: Found match for regex: =
Page 562 rošáda: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|cs|rocháda}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|cs|rocháda}}, from {{bor|cs|de|Rochade||castling}}, from {{der|cs|gmh|roch||rook}}, from {{der|cs|fa|رخ|tr=rox||war elephant}}.<ref name="Rejzek"/> The original Czech expression ''rocháda'' mistakenly acquired [[w:French language|French]] pronunciation with the letter ⟨ch⟩ pronounced as {{IPAchar|/ʃ/}} (especially among non-professional chess players), which later (in the 1950s) lead also to the change of spelling to the letter ⟨š⟩ (''rošáda'').<ref name="Rejzek"/><ref name="CTC"/><ref name="Nase rec"/>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|aːda|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|ro|šá|da}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{lb|cs|chess}} [[castling]]
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2008|author=Ivan Kopecký|title=Čas fízlů|page=1088|publisher=Hafan Libri|location=|url=https://books.google.cz/books?hl=cs&id=hTQqAQAAIAAJ&dq=ro%C5%A1%C3%A1dou|isbn=978-80-904084-1-8|passage=Ovládá vůbec tento Szabó základní tahy pěšcem a koněm a dámský gambit a Nimcovičovu obranu a ví vůbec, jaký je rozdíl mezi malou a velkou rošádou?|translation=Does this Szabó know the basic moves of the pawn and knight and the Nimzowitsch Defence, and does he know at all what the difference between the kingside and queenside castling is?}}
# [[change]] of a person in a position
#* {{quote-journal|cs|date=2015-11-18|author=Martin Korbáš|title=Voráček a Krejčí si připsali po dvou asistencích, bodoval i Jaškin|newspaper=iDnes|url=http://hokej.idnes.cz/voracek-a-krejci-si-pripsali-po-dvou-asistencich-fui-/nhl.aspx?c=A151118_064424_nhl_Mkr|passage=Pomohla jim k tomu i trenérská rošáda, když na konci října odvolaného Todda Richardse nahradil bouřlivák John Torntorella.|translation=A swap of trainers helped them to it, when the hothead John Tontorella replaced withdrawn Todd Richards.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Derived terms====
{{col-auto|cs|rošovat|rošádový|malá rošáda|velká rošáda}}

====Related terms====
{{col-auto|cs|rochovat}}

===References===
