===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|socha|*socha}} meant “mast, pillar, column” and was derived from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*soxa||crotch of a tree, trunk ending with a branch stub}} with unsure origins.<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref> The current Czech and Slovak meaning derives from the fact such pillars in homes were ornamented with wood carvings.<ref>{{R:cs:Machek 1968}}</ref>

