Page 1391 jelenka: Found match for regex: [
Page 1391 jelenka: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Elaphomyces muricatus.jpg|thumbnail|[[jelenka pestrá]]<br/>(''Elaphomyces muricatus'')]]
{{commonscat|Elaphomyces}}
{{wikispecies|Elaphomyces}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|cs|jelen|t1=deer|ka}}. Old common name, which used to be used for mushrooms of the genera {{taxlinknew|Elaphomyces|genus|noshow=1}} and {{taxlinknew|Phallus|genus|noshow=1}}. Since 1901 the name is used solely for the genus ''Elaphomyces'', following the suggestion of Czech botanist Jan Bezděk.<ref name="Bezděk"/> The name probably reflects the fact that these mushrooms are liked by deer.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛŋka|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|je|len|ka}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{taxlinknew|Elaphomyces|genus|noshow=1}}, genus of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Elaphomycetaceae|family|noshow=1}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2013|author=Michal Mikšík|title=Poznáváme jarní houby|page=11|publisher=Grada|location=Praha|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=HOS-AgAAQBAJ&pg=PA132#v=onepage&q&f=false|isbn=978-80-247-4403-2|passage=Mezi zástupce askomycetů patří i některé podzemní rody hub, jako např. '''jelenka''' (rod ''Elaphomyces'') nebo lanýž (rod ''Tuber'').|translation=Some underground genera of fungi also belong among Ascomycota, such as "''jelenka''" (genus ''Elaphomyces'') or truffle (genus ''Tuber'').}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|genus}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|vřeckovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|plesnivkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|jelenkovité}}&nbsp;– family

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|genus Chamaemyces}} {{l|cs|jelenka bradavčitá}}, {{l|cs|jelenka draslavá}}, {{l|cs|jelenka ježatá}}, {{l|cs|jelenka obecná}}, {{l|cs|jelenka pestrá}}, {{l|cs|jelenka skvrnitá}}&nbsp;– species

====Related terms====
{{col-auto|cs|jelen|jelínek|jelení|jelenice|jelenicový}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="Bezděk">Jan Bezděk (1901). ''Houby jedlé a jim podobné jedovaté'' '''2'''. Praha.</ref>
</references>

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:Myko|Elaphomyces}}
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}

{{C|cs|Mushrooms}}
