{{was fwotd|cs|2020|October|18}}
[[File:Baumsäge.jpg|thumbnail|břichatka (a kind of [[saw]])]]
[[File:Giuseppe_maggiolini,_cassettone,_1773_circa.JPG|thumbnail|břichatka (a kind of [[commode]])]]
[[File:Calvatia gigantea.jpg|thumbnail|[[pýchavka obrovská]], {{taxlink|Calvatia gigantea|species|noshow=1}} (a gasteroid fungus)]]
[[File:Oneirodes macrosteus.JPG|thumbnail|břichatka kostnatá, {{taxlink|Oneirodes macrosteus|species|noshow=1}}]]
[[File:Ceriodaphnia.jpg|thumbnail|břichatka, ''[[Ceriodaphnia]]'']]

===Etymology===
From {{af|cs|břich<t:stomach>|-atý|-ka}}. It refers to the rounded (belly-like) shape of the object.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|atka|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|bři|chat|ka}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# kind of [[two-man]] [[crosscut saw]] with a blade that is wider in the middle
# {{lb|cs|colloquial}} kind of antique [[commode]] of a [[rounded]] shape
# [[gasteroid]] [[fungus]] {{gloss|fungus from the [[polyphyletic]] group [[Gasteromycetes]] containing [[puffball]]s, [[stinkhorn]]s, [[bird's nest fungus|bird's nest fungi]] or [[false truffle]]s, which produce spores inside their fruiting bodies}}
#* {{quote-journal|cs|date=2012-08-29|author=Martin Mička|title=Houbaři, vrchol sezony by měl teprve přijít!|newspaper=Orlický deník.cz|url=http://orlicky.denik.cz/z-regionu/houbari-vrchol-sezony-by-mel-teprve-prijit-20120828.html|passage=Další opomíjenou, a přesto výbornou houbou jsou pýchavky. […] Patří do skupiny '''břichatek''', kde výtrusy zrají uvnitř plodnice a v pravý čas prasknou a vypráší do vzduchu miliony výtrusů.|translation=Another neglected but tasty mushrooms are puffballs. […] They belong to the group of gasteroid fungi, whose spores ripen inside their fruiting body, and which burst in the right time and dust off millions of spores.}}
# [[dreamer]], fish from the family {{taxlink|Oneirodidae|family|noshow=1}}
# ''[[Ceriodaphnia]]'', genus of [[water flea]]s from the order [[Cladocera]]

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|saw}} {{l|cs|pila}}
* {{sense|fungus}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division
* {{sense|fish}} {{l|cs|živočichové}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|strunatci}}&nbsp;– phylum; {{l|cs|paprskoploutví}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|ďasové}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|břichatkovití}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|Ceriodaphnia}} {{l|cs|živočichové}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|členovci}}&nbsp;– Phylum; {{l|cs|lupenonožci}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|perloočky}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|hrotnatkovití}}&nbsp;– family

====Hyponyms====
