===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|cs|penízkovka}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|cs|peníz||coin}}, referring to the shape of the head of some of these mushrooms.<ref name="Machek"/>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ofka|s=4}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|pe|ní|zov|ka}}

===Noun===
[[File:Snowy Cap and Velvet Feet (2065745557).jpg|thumbnail|[[penízovka sametonohá]] ({{taxlink|Flammulina velutipes|species|ver=220420}})]]
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{taxlink|Callistosporium|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# ''[[Collybia]]'' {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# {{taxlink|Flammulina|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Physalacriaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Gymnopus|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Omphalotaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Pseudobaeospora|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# {{taxlink|Rhodocollybia|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Omphalotaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Strobilurus|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Physalacriaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Tephrocybe|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Lyophyllaceae|family}}}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|genera Callistosporium, Collybia and Pseudobaeospora}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|čirůvkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genera Flammulina and Strobilurus}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|měchýřečkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genera Gymnopus and Rhodocollybia}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|hlívovníkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genus Tephrocybe}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|líhovité}}&nbsp;– family

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|Callistosporium}} {{l|cs|penízovka olivová}}, {{l|cs|penízovka troudní}}&nbsp;– species
* {{sense|Collybia}} {{l|cs|penízovka Cookeova}}, {{l|cs|penízovka hlíznatá}}, {{l|cs|penízovka třásnitá}}&nbsp;– species
* {{sense|Flammulina}} {{l|cs|penízovka jehlicová}}, {{l|cs|penízovka letní}}, {{l|cs|penízovka sametonohá}}&nbsp;– species
