Page 2243 čirůvka: Found match for regex: [
Page 2243 čirůvka: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Lepista nuda cropped.jpg|thumbnail|[[čirůvka fialová]]<br/>(''Lepista nuda'')]]
[[File:Gąska niekształtna 1.jpg|thumbnail|[[čirůvka havelka]]<br/>(''Tricholoma portentosum'')]]
[[File:Calocybe gambosa 950.jpg|thumbnail|[[čirůvka májovka]]<br/>(''Calocybe gambosa'')]]

===Etymology===
Botanist [[w:Jan Svatopluk Presl|Jan Svatopluk Presl]] used the name {{m|cs|čirůwka}} in 1846 for the [[genus]] ''[[Russula]]''<ref name="Presl"/> (which is called {{m|cs|holubinka}} in {{noncog|cs|-}} nowadays), but the word is older with unclear origins. It is related to the {{cog|pl|-}} dialect expression {{m|pl|cyr||mushroom}}, {{cog|pl|czyr||tinder}} and {{cog|uk|чір||tinder}}.<ref name="Machek"/>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|uːfka|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|či|rův|ka}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{taxlink|Lepista|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# {{taxlink|Porpoloma|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# ''[[Tricholoma]]'' {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# {{taxlink|Calocybe|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Lyophyllaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Rugosomyces|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Lyophyllaceae|family}}}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|genera Lepista, Porpoloma and Tricholoma}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|čirůvkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genera Calocybe and Rugosomyces}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|líhovité}}&nbsp;– family

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|Lepista}} {{l|cs|čirůvka dvoubarvá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka fialová}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka kosatcová}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka plstnatá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka Rickenova}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka špinavá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka těžká}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka vejčitovýtrusá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka zamlžená}}, {{l|cs|strmělka přehrnutá}}&nbsp;– species
* {{sense|Porpoloma}} {{l|cs|čirůvka černavá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka sítinomilná}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka špičatá}}, {{l|cs|čirůvka osténkatá}}&nbsp;– species
