Alternatively from {{der|cs|sqj-pro|*ōtar}},<ref>{{R:sq:Orel|pages=495–496}}</ref><ref>{{R:Domosiletskaya|page=457}}</ref><ref>{{R:ine:EIEC|263}}</ref> also from {{der|cs|ira-pro|*ātr-}}.

