Page 5396 hlíva: Found match for regex: {
Page 5396 hlíva: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
The word is known from {{cog|zlw-ocs|-}}, when it referred to a kind of fungus, probably fungus of the [[genus]] {{m|mul|Pleurotus}} as in modern Czech.<ref name="Machek"/> It is related to {{cog|dsb|gliwk||resin}}, {{cog|orv|глива||slime, clay}}, {{cog|ru|-}} dialect {{m|ru|гли́ва||bergamot pear}}, {{cog|uk|глива||oyster mushroom}} or {{cog|sh|gljȉva||mushroom}}. Comes from {{der|cs|sla-pro|*gliva}}, which was probably derived from {{m|sla-pro|*glivěti||cover with slime}} and is related to {{cog|lt|gleĩvės||slime}} or {{cog|lv|glīve||algal bloom}}.<ref name="Trubachyov"/><ref name="Rejzek"/>

[[File:Pleurotus ostreatus - Pleurote en huître cropped.jpg|thumbnail|[[hlíva ústřičná]] (''[[Pleurotus ostreatus]]'')]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|iːva|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|hlí|va}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# [[oyster mushroom]], ''[[Pleurotus]]'' {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Pleurotaceae]]}} {{defdate|probably from 14th c.}}
# {{taxlink|Tectella|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Mycenaceae|family}}}}
# {{taxlink|Phyllotopsis|genus}} {{gloss|[[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] in the family [[Tricholomataceae]]}}
# some species of fungi in the family [[Polyporaceae]]
## [[hlíva fialová]] ({{taxlink|Panus conchatus|genus}})
## [[hlíva chlupatá]] ({{taxlink|Lentinus strigosus|genus}})
# {{lb|cs|pathology|obsolete}} [[gumma]], non-cancerous growth from the tertiary stage of [[syphilis]]
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1896|author=Vítězslav Janovský|title=Ottův slovník naučný|chapter=Gumma|page=617|volume=X|publisher=J. Otto|location=Praha|url=http://archive.org/stream/ottvslovnknauni02ottogoog#page/n636/mode/1up|passage=Gumma, '''hlíva''', nazývá se druh novotvaru příjičného, který v podobě uzlů ostře ohraničených se jeví na kůži a ostatních orgánech lidského těla jako pozdní projev příjice […]|translation='''Gumma''' is a kind of syphilitic growth, which appears on the skin and other human body organs in the form of sharply bordered lumps as a late manifestation of syphilis […]}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|syphilitic growth}} {{l|cs|gumma}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|genus Pleurotus}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|hlívovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genus Tectella}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|helmovkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|genus Phyllotopsis}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|pečárkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|čirůvkovité}}&nbsp;– family
* {{sense|syphilitic growth}} {{l|cs|novotvar}}

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|genus Pleurotus}} {{l|cs|hlíva čepičkatá}}, {{l|cs|hlíva dubová}}, {{l|cs|hlíva holubí}}, {{l|cs|hlíva máčková}}, {{l|cs|hlíva miskovitá}}, {{l|cs|hlíva plicní}}, {{l|cs|hlíva růžová}}, {{l|cs|hlíva ústřičná}}, {{l|cs|hlíva žlutá}}&nbsp;– species
* {{sense|genus Tectella}} {{l|cs|hlíva číškovitá}}&nbsp;– species
* {{sense|genus Phyllotopsis}} {{l|cs|hlíva hnízdovitá}}, {{l|cs|hlíva škeblovitá}}&nbsp;– species

