[[File:Zea_mays_-_Köhler–s_Medizinal-Pflanzen-283.jpg|thumb|Kukuřice]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|cs|kukuryce|kukuruc||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
Attested in Karel Thám's ''Deutsch-böhmisches National-lexikon'' (1788), in actual usage at least since 1798. A [[wanderword]] of unknown Balkan origin, perhaps from {{der|cs|ota|قوقوروز|tr=kukuruz|sc=ota-Arab}} or {{der|cs|sh|kukuruz}}. The ending of the modern form is probably due to paronymic attraction to common suffix {{m|cs|-ice}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# [[maize]], [[corn]]
#* {{quote-text|cs|year=1798|author=Ladislav Bohuslav Bartholomeides|title=Geograffia aneb Wypsáni Okrsslku Zemského s ssesti Mappami wlasni rukau geho wyrytými
|passage=Opogný nápog také milugi, z '''kukuřice''', kterau ženy zwikagi, a s slinámi do nádoby mecý, dělagi.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

