===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|cs|de|Rolle}}, from {{der|cs|fro|rolle}}, {{m|fro|role||parchment scroll, inventory}}, from {{der|cs|la|rotula}}, {{m|la|rotulus||little wheel}}, which is a [[Appendix:Glossary#diminutive|diminutive]] of {{m|la|rota||wheel}}.<ref name="Rejzek1"/>

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{l|en|role}}, [[part]] {{gloss|of an actor}} {{defdate|19th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|úloha|part}}
# [[line]]s {{gloss|spoken text of an actor playing a part}}
#: {{syn|cs|part}}
# {{l|en|role}} {{gloss|e.g. of a person in a society}}
#: {{syn|cs|úloha}}
# {{lb|cs|linguistics}} {{l|en|role}} {{gloss|function of a constituent in a clause}}
# [[scroll]] {{defdate|19th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|svitek}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|f}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|rolička}}

=====Related terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|rolovat|roláda}}

===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|cs|sla-pro|*orlьja}}, from{{m|sla-pro|*orati}}.<ref name="Rejzek2"/>

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|f}}

# {{lb|cs|obsolete|literary}} [[field]] {{gloss|area to grow crops}} {{defdate|14th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|pole}}
# old unit of field measurement
# {{lb|cs|obsolete|literary}} [[area]], [[domain]] {{gloss|of activity}}
#: {{syn|cs|obor|okruh}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1910|author=Antonín Zoglmann|title=Český lid|volume=XIX|chapter=Paměti starého učitele. (II.)|page=412–418|publisher=F. Šimáček|location=Praha|url=|passage=[…] horlivý, tichý pracovník na roli školské […]|translation=[…] avid, quiet worker in the domain of education […]}}

