Page 9518 bek: -------- begin text --------
{{was fwotd|cs|2018|December|10}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛk|s=1}}
* {{homophones|cs|beg}}

===Etymology 1===

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[bleat]]
#: {{syn|cs|bekot|bečení}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1902|author=Josef K. Šlejhar|title=Temno|chapter= |page=210|publisher=J. Otto|location= |url=https://books.google.cz/books?hl=cs&id=7RJLAAAAYAAJ&dq=bek|passage=V tu dobu zase žalný bekot telátka přerývavě zazněl z chléva. Nejistý, bázlivý byl to '''bek''' […]|translation=Sad bleating was heard disjointedly from the barn in that time. It was uncertain, timid '''bleating''' […]}}
# [[cry]]
#: {{syn|cs|pláč|brek|brekot|brečení}}
#* {{quote-journal
|cs
|year=1900
|first=Josef
|last=Holeček
|volume=45
|magazine=Květy
|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=JbozAQAAMAAJ&q=%22do+beku%22
|passage=Frantík tentokrát nedal se pro sklamání do '''beku'''.
|translation=This time Frantík didn't start '''crying''' because of his disappointment.
}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

====Interjection====
{{head|cs|interjection}}

# {{lb|cs|onomatopoeia}} {{n-g|the characteristic bark of a [[roe deer]]}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2015|author=[[w:Karel Čapek|Karel Čapek]]|title=Hordubal|page=37|publisher=KKnihy.cz|location= |url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=BdPOBwAAQBAJ&pg=PT37#v=onepage&q&f=false|isbn=978-80-88061-21-2|passage=Bek, bek, povídá, zadupe kopýtky a kluše dál.|translation="Bark, bark", she says, stamps with her little hooves and keeps trotting.}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{m|cs|back}}, which was {{glossary|loanword|borrowed}} from {{bor|cs|en|back}}. See also {{m|cs|bachyně}}.<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015|bek|80}}</ref>

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|cs|back||archaic}}

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-an}}

# {{lb|cs|colloquial|sport}} [[back]] {{defdate|20th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|obránce|zadák}}
#: {{ant|cs|útočník|forward}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1996|author=[[w:Bohumil Hrabal|Bohumil Hrabal]]|title=Ze zápisníku zapisovatele|page=251|publisher=Pražská imaginace|location=Praha|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=deBgAAAAMAAJ&q=bek|isbn=80-7110-165-6|passage=Vojta Bradáč dvěma góly vyrovnal a pak zdánlivě kulhající Puč najednou nekulhal, obešel halvy, pak po něm vystartoval '''bek''' Černý, ale Puč dělovkou překonal brankáře Tichého a já jsem odcházel z hřiště smutný…|translation=Vojta Bradáč equalized with two goals and then seemingly limping Puč suddenly wasn't limping, got through the half-backs, then '''back''' Černý started off against him, but Puč defeated goalkeeper Tichý with a hard shot and I was leaving the pitch sad…}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m.an}}

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# {{lb|cs|inanimate|colloquial|sport}} [[defense]] {{gloss|portion of a team dedicated to defending}} {{defdate|20th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|obrana|defenziva|defenzíva}}
#: {{ant|cs|útok|ofenziva|ofenzíva}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1999|author=[[w:Vlasta Chramostová|Vlasta Chramostová]]|title=Vlasta Chramostová|page=176|publisher=Doplněk|location=Brno|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=9Wk0AAAAMAAJ&q=%22na+beku%22|isbn=80-7239-054-6|passage=Standíkovi bylo třináct čtrnáct a hrál na '''beku'''.|translation=Standík was thirteen or fourteen and played in the '''defense'''.}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

===References===
<references/>

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}
* {{R:cs:IJP}}

