Page 9608 kolek: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|Kolek|kolek|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
Diminutive of {{m|cs|kůl||stake}}, {{suffix|cs|kůl|ek}}. Originally referred also to small wooden cylinders used as seal matrixes,<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref> and, from that, to the seal impression. The modern meaning derives from that, as seals proving a paid fee were replaced by special paper labels.<ref>{{R:cs:Machek 1968}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[revenue stamp]]
# {{lb|cs|obsolete}} {{diminutive of|cs|kůl}}
#: {{syn|cs|kolík|g=m}}
# {{lb|cs|obsolete}} [[seal]] {{gloss|printing matrix or its impression}}
#: {{syn|cs|pečeť|g=f}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

