===Etymology===
{{coined|cs|Jan Svatopluk Presl}} in the 19th century based on {{der|cs|pl|czołg||tank}} from {{m|pl|[[czołgać]] się||to creep, to crawl}}.<ref>{{R:cs:Machek 1968}}</ref><ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-an}}

# [[newt]]

====Usage notes====
This term is used only for some genera (e.g. {{taxlink|Lissotriton|genus|ver=180318}} or ''[[Triturus]]'') of the family [[Salamandridae]]. For other species of newt, the word ''[[mlok]]'' is used.

