* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛtʃɛk|s=4}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|pra|dě|de|ček}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-an}}

# [[great-grandfather]]

====Usage notes====
Additional prefixes {{m|cs|pra-}} can be prepended to the term, each indicating one further generation of ancestry. Thus the Czech expression for the father of someone's great-grandfather is {{m|cs|prapradědeček||great-great-grandfather}}, the expression for his father is {{m|cs||praprapradědeček|great-great-grandfather}} and so on.

====Declension====
