[[File:Chestnut-breasted Negrofinch from Canopy Walkway - Kakum NP - Ghana 14 S4E1256 (16197929651).jpg|thumb|černoušek]]
[[File:Melanogaster tuberiformis 17757.jpg|thumb|černoušek (''[[Melanogaster]]'')]]

===Etymology===
From {{affix|cs|černý|-oušek}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-an}}

# {{diminutive of|cs|černoch}}
# [[nigrita]]

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|m.an}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[melanogaster]] {{gloss|a [[genus]] of [[fungus|fungi]] from the family [[Melanogastraceae]]}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2015|author=Michal Mikšík|title=Poznáváme jarní houby|page=34|publisher=Grada Publishing|location=Praha|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=HOS-AgAAQBAJ&pg=PA34&dq=%C4%8Dernou%C5%A1ek#v=onepage&q=%C4%8Dernou%C5%A1ek&f=false|isbn=978-80-247-8466-3|passage=Z dalších rodů podzemek byly najaře nalezeny také druhy z rodu '''černoušek''' (rod Melanogaster), kterých je z Evropy známo cca 8 druhů.|translation=Other species of underground fungi found in the spring included some species of the '''''Melanogaster''''' genera, of which about 8 species are known from Europe.}}

====Usage notes====
* Although the word ''černoušek'' in the sense of fungi should be declined as masculine inanimate, in practical colloquial usage the animate declension also sometimes appears.<ref name="Nase rec"/> Per IJP, animate forms can appear in the genitive and accusative singular, but such forms in the nominative plural are considered "expressive" and non-standard. See [[https://prirucka.ujc.cas.cz/en/?slovo=klouzek the declension of klouzek]] for an example.

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|m.gena:u.acc-:a}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|genus}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|hřibotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|černouškovité}}&nbsp;– family

====Hyponyms====
* {{sense|genus}} {{l|cs|černoušek Broomeův}}, {{l|cs|černoušek lanýžovitý}}, {{l|cs|černoušek obojetný}}, {{l|cs|černoušek pestrý}}, {{l|cs|černoušek prostřední}}

====Related terms====
{{col-auto|cs|modroušek}}

