Page 11943 čobol: Found match for regex: =
Page 11943 čobol: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{rfref|cs|Guessing etymology, lacks sources}}
From Slovak ''[[čo]] [[bol]]'' ("what was" or "who was"), a very frequent collocation of words significantly different from their Czech equivalents (Czech ''[[co]] [[byl]]''). Possibly associated with a catchphrase ''čo bolo, to bolo, terazky som majorom'' ("what's past is past, I am a major now") used by the character of Slovak Major Haluška in [[w:Miloslav Švandrlík|Miroslav Švandrlík]]'s satirical novel ''[[w:Černí baroni (book)|Černí baroni]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|g=m-an}}

# {{lb|cs|derogatory|ethnic slur}} {{l|en|Slovak}} (person)
#: {{syn|cs|čobolák|Slovák|q1=derogatory|q2=neutral}}

====Declension====
