====Usage notes====
{{w|Czech language|Czech}} noun {{m|cs|gól}} is usually [[declension|declined]] as [[inanimate]] (so the genitive and accusative forms are ''gól''), but occasionally colloquial [[animate]] declension occurs (with genitive and accusative forms {{m|cs|góla}}, such as ''Dal góla'' – "He scored"). In this way the speaker usually shows his personal relationship or emotional attitude to the object.<ref>{{cite-book|author=Václav Cvrček |coauthors=et al.|title=Mluvnice současné češtiny| url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=nQejCgAAQBAJ&pg=PA203&dq=g%C3%B3la#v=onepage&q=g%C3%B3la&f=false |location=Praha |publisher=Karolinum |year=2015 |volume=1 |page=203 |isbn=978-80-246-2812-7}}</ref>

