Page 13187 sen: Found match for regex: =
Page 13187 sen: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|sen}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛn|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{root|cs|ine-pro|*swep-}} {{dercat|cs|sla-pro|ine-bsl-pro|ine-pro|inh=2}}
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|sen}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*sъ̀nъ}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-bsl-pro|*súpnas}}, from {{inh|cs|ine-pro|*supnós}}.

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[dream]]
#: {{uxi|cs|Měl jsem o tobě '''sen'''.|I had a '''dream''' about you.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|To by mě ani ve '''snu''' nenapadlo.|I wouldn't even dream of that.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Bylo to jako '''ze sna'''.|It was totally '''out of a dream'''.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Polovinu času tráví '''ve snách'''.|He lives '''in a dream''' half the time.}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m.*.genu:a.locplech:ách}}

The form {{m|cs|sna}} is usually only used after the preposition {{m|cs|ze}} ({{m|cs||ze sna}}) and the form {{m|cs|snách}} is usually only used after the preposition {{m|cs|ve}} ({{m|cs||ve snách}}).

=====Related terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|snít|bezesný|snový}}

====See also====
* {{l|cs|vidina|g=f}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}
* {{R:cs:IJP}}

