Page 13816 lado: Found match for regex: =
Page 13816 lado: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|lado}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*lędo}},<ref name="machek">{{R:cs:Machek 1968}}</ref> from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*lendʰ-}},<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref> cognate with {{cog|en|land}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|la|do}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|n}}

# uncultivated, wild land

====Usage notes====
