Page 13859 Jidášovo ucho: Found match for regex: [
Page 13859 Jidášovo ucho: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Judasohr Auricularia auricula judae.jpg|thumbnail|Jidášovo ucho<br/>(''Auricularia auricula-judae'')]]
{{wikipedia|lang=cs|Ucho Jidášovo}}
{{commons|Auricularia auricula-judae}}
{{wikispecies|Auricularia auricula-judae}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|cs|ucho Jidášovo}}

===Etymology===
The possessive adjective {{m|cs|Jidášovo||Judas', belonging to Judas}} refers to a legend saying that [[Judas Iscariot]] hanged himself on a [[black elder]] tree, on which this fungus commonly grows. The noun {{m|cs|ucho||ear}} refers to the shape of the fruiting body of the fungus.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|n|head=[[Jidášův|Jidášovo]] [[ucho]]}}

# [[Jew's-ear]], ''{{l|mul|Auricularia auricula-judae}}'' {{gloss|edible [[mushroom]] growing especially on trunks of [[black elder]], ''[[Sambucus nigra]]''}}
#: {{syn|cs|boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo|;|boltcovitka bezová|;|bezovka ucho Jidášovo<q:obsolete>}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2014|author=Jan Cimický|title=Tisíc jiskérek na noční obloze|page=102|publisher=Baronet Publishers|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=HOS-AgAAQBAJ&pg=PA132#v=onepage&q&f=false|isbn=978-80-247-4403-2|passage=[[…]] proto jsou mnohé zdejší stromy starší než tisíc let a stále bohatě plodí. V jejich kůře se po odkvětu a odplození dokonce pěstují houby, známé pod jménem '''Jidášovo ucho''', významná součást čínské kuchyně.|translation=[[…]] that is why many local trees are older than thousand years and keep bearing a lot of fruit. After they go out of bloom and fruit, people grow mushrooms, known as Jew's-ear, which is an important part of Chinese cuisine, in their bark.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|[[Jidášův|Jidášovo]]<+> ucho<n>}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|species}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|boltcovitkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|boltcovitkovité}}&nbsp;– family; {{l|cs|boltcovitka}}&nbsp;– genus

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:Myko|Auricularia-auricula-judae}}

{{C|cs|Mushrooms}}
