# {{lb|cs|sport}} in tennis etc., a ball's unexpected change of direction as a result of touching the net, which ends within bounds if left alone. In table tennis also a ball's unexpected change of direction as a result of falling precisely on the table's edge.<!-- This is not necessarily a "let" as it does not have to happen at a service and can thus be considered a legal play. -->
# a spot of light on a surface as a result of reflection from a glazy surface such as the face of a wristwatch
# {{lb|cs|sports}} [[jack]] {{gloss|for bowls or pétanque}}
#: {{syn|cs|košonek}}

