===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|n}}

# [[warmth]]
# {{lb|cs|physics}} [[heat]]

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|n.loce:u}}

===Adverb===
{{cs-adv}}

# [[warm]] {{gloss|of weather}}

====Usage notes====
In phrases related to weather, Czech only uses adjectives when related to a specified feature, e.g.
: {{uxi|cs|Obloha je [[zatažený|zatažená]].|The sky is overcast.}}
: {{uxi|cs|Vzduch je [[teplý]].|The air is warm.}}
Otherwise, adverbs are used, e.g.
: {{uxi|cs|Je '''zataženo'''.|It's overcast.}}
: {{uxi|cs|Je [[teplo]].|It's warm.}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}
* {{R:cs:IJP}}

