Page 14653 ucho Jidášovo: Found match for regex: [
Page 14653 ucho Jidášovo: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Auricularia auricula-judae Lodz(Poland)(js)01.jpg|thumbnail|ucho Jidášovo<br/>(''Auricularia auricula-judae'')]]
{{wikipedia|lang=cs}}
{{commons|Auricularia auricula-judae}}
{{wikispecies|Auricularia auricula-judae}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|cs|Jidášovo ucho}}

===Etymology===
The noun {{m|cs|ucho||ear}} refers to the shape of the fruiting body of the fungus. The adjective {{m|cs|Jidášovo||Judas', belonging to Judas}} refers to a legend saying that [[Judas Iscariot]] hanged himself on a [[black elder]] tree, on which this fungus commonly grows.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|n|head=[[ucho]] [[Jidášův|Jidášovo]]}}

# [[Jew's-ear]], ''{{l|mul|Auricularia auricula-judae}}'' {{gloss|edible [[mushroom]] growing especially on trunks of [[black elder]], ''[[Sambucus nigra]]''}}
#: {{syn|cs|boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo|;|boltcovitka bezová|;|bezovka ucho Jidášovo<q:obsolete>}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=2013|author=Michal Mikšík|title=Poznáváme jarní houby|page=132|publisher=Grada|location=Praha|url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=HOS-AgAAQBAJ&pg=PA132#v=onepage&q&f=false|isbn=978-80-247-4403-2|passage=Ucho Jidášovo je jedlá dobrá houba, která se hojně používá zejména v asijské kuchyni.|translation=Jew's-ear is an edible tasty mushroom, which is frequently used especially in Asian cuisine.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|ucho<n> [[Jidášův|Jidášovo]]<+>}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|species}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|boltcovitkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|boltcovitkovité}}&nbsp;– family; {{l|cs|boltcovitka}}&nbsp;– genus

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:Myko|Auricularia-auricula-judae}}

{{C|cs|Mushrooms}}
-------- end text --------
Page 14654 boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo: Found match for regex: [
Page 14654 boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo: -------- begin text --------
[[File:Auricularia auricula-judae5.jpg|thumbnail|boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo<br/>(''Auricularia auricula-judae'')]]
{{wikipedia|lang=cs|Ucho Jidášovo}}
{{commons|Auricularia auricula-judae}}
{{wikispecies|Auricularia auricula-judae}}

===Etymology===
The noun {{m|cs|boltcovitka||''Auricularia''}} is the genus of the fungus and is derived from {{m|cs|boltec||auricle}}. It refers to the shape of its fruiting body, as does the following noun {{m|cs|ucho||ear}}. The possessive adjective {{m|cs|Jidášovo||Judas', belonging to Judas}} refers to a legend saying that [[Judas Iscariot]] hanged himself on a [[black elder]] tree, on which this fungus commonly grows.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA|"boltcovitka "?ucho "Jidášovo}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|f}}

# [[Jew's-ear]], ''{{l|mul|Auricularia auricula-judae}}'' {{gloss|edible [[mushroom]] growing especially on trunks of [[black elder]], ''[[Sambucus nigra]]''}}
#: {{syn|cs|ucho Jidášovo|;|boltcovitka bezová|;|bezovka ucho Jidášovo<q:obsolete>}}
#* {{quote-journal|cs|date=2014-04-21|author=Emil Kalabus|title=O léčivých houbách a evropské legislativě|newspaper=Czech Free Press|url=http://www.czechfreepress.cz/evropa/o-lecivych-houbach-a-evropske-legislative.html|passage=Dalším druhem zajímavé a léčivé houby je Boltcovitka ucho Jidášovo [[…]]|translation=Another interesting and curative fungus species is Jew's ear [[…]]}}

====Declension====
{{rfinfl|cs|noun}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|species}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|boltcovitkotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|boltcovitkovité}}&nbsp;– family; {{l|cs|boltcovitka}}&nbsp;– genus

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:Myko|Auricularia-auricula-judae}}

{{C|cs|Mushrooms}}
