{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|sklep}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*sъklepъ}}. Cognate with {{cognate|pl|sklep}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|sklep}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛp|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[cellar]] {{gloss|storage space}}

====Usage notes====
* Unlike a ''cellar'', a ''sklep'' can also be on the ground floor. This is usually the case in [[block of flats|blocks of flats]] of the [[panelák]] sort. In such cases these storage [[closet]]s are grouped together, rather than adjacent to their respective flats (which are mostly on higher [[floor]]s).

