From verb {{m|cs|odpařit||vaporize}}, from noun {{m|cs|pára||vapour}}, which is from {{der|cs|sla-pro|*para}}, {{m|sla-pro|*parъ}}, derived from {{m|sla-pro|*pariti||to steam, to burn}}. Probably comes from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*preh₁-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|od|par}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[vaporization]]

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}
* {{R:cs:IJP}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|cs|dropa}}
* {{l|cs|porad}}

{{cln|cs|terms prefixed with od-}}
