Page 15039 bor: Found match for regex: {
Page 15039 bor: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|cs|zlw-ocs|bor}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*borъ}}. Because in {{cog|sk|-}} and {{cog|pl|-}} dialects it means "marsh", it is sometimes associated with {{cog|sla-pro|*bara}}, meanig the same. More probably it is connected with {{der|cs|ine-pro|*bʰor-u-}}. Compare also {{m|cs|borůvka}}.<ref name="Rejzek"/>

====Pronunciation====
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|or|s=1}}

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[wood]] consisting of [[pine]]s, pine wood
#* '''1834''', František Škroup, “Kde domov můj” (national anthem of the Czech Republic). Lyrics by Josef Kajetán Tyl:
#*: Kde domov můj, kde domov můj? / Voda hučí po lučinách, / '''bory''' šumí po skalinách, / v sadě skví se jara květ, / zemský ráj to na pohled!

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|boroví|borovice|borovička|borovicový|borový}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|cs|de|Bor}}, which is a shortened form of {{m|de|Borax}} derived from {{cog|ML.|borax}}, from {{cog|ar|بورق||būraq}}, from {{cog|fa|بوره||būrah}}.<ref name="Rejzek2"/>
{{elements|cs|B|berylium|Be|uhlík|C}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|cs|bór}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{cs-IPA|bór}}<ref name="Čmejrková et al"/>
* {{rhymes|cs|oːr}}

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|m-in}}

# [[boron]]

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|m}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|boran|borid|boritý|borosilikátový}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="Rejzek">{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015|bor<sup>1</sup>|92–93}}</ref>
<ref name="Rejzek2">{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015|bor<sup>2</sup>|93}}</ref>
<ref name="Čmejrková et al">{{cite-book|year=2013|author=Čmejrková, Světla; Hoffmannová, Jana; Klímová, Jana|title=Čeština v pohledu synchronním a diachronním|ISBN=8024621215|page=433|link=https://books.google.cz/books?id=KwUxBQAAQBAJ&pg=PA433#v=onepage&q&f=false|lang=cs}}</ref>
</references>

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|cs|obr}}
* {{l|cs|rob}}

{{C|cs|Chemical elements|Forests}}

-------- end text --------
Page 15040 odbor: Found match for regex: {
Page 15040 odbor: -------- begin text --------
{{wp|lang=cs}}

===Etymology===
Fairly recent, possibly contamination from {{m|cs|obor}} + {{m|cs|oddíl}};<ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2007}}</ref> [[w:Josef Jungmann|Jungmann]]’s ''Czech–German Dictionary'' (1834–39) listed the word only with the mathematical meaning of {{m|cs|lemma}}, {{m|de|Heischesatz}},<ref>[http://kramerius.nkp.cz/kramerius/handle/ABA001/10881282 ODBOR in Josef Jungmann, ''Slownjk česko-německý Josefa Jungmanna'', Djl II. K–O. 1836. p. 826]</ref> quoting [[w:cs:Antonín Marek|Marek]]’s ''Logic''.<ref>[http://kramerius.nkp.cz/kramerius/handle/ABA001/18511306 Antonín Marek, ''Logika nebo umnice''. 1820. p. 123]</ref>

===Pronunciation===
