===Etymology===
Of {{w|Lower Sorbian}} origin. Compare {{m|dsb|Bramborska||Brandenburg}}. Interpreted as "crop from {{w|Brandenburg}}", as imported to Bohemia by {{w|Kingdom_of_Prussia|Prussian}} soldiers during the {{w|War of the Bavarian Succession}} (1778–1779).<ref>{{R:cs:Nase rec|author=Antonín Frinta|title=Česká jména lužickosrbského původu|artno=4509|year=1956|volume=39|issue=9–10}}</ref><ref>{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015||95}}</ref>

