====Usage notes====
* Unlike ''disident'', this form is not in the official word list ''Pravidla českého pravopisu'' and is not in ''Internetová jazyková příručka''. As a result, some Czech speakers will consider this form to be incorrect. This spelling corresponds to one of the two common pronunciations of ''disident''. For contrast, ''Pravidla'' allows ''dizertace'' together with ''disertace''.

