===Etymology===
First known occurrence of the expression in the Czech language (16th century) was in the sense {{m|en|side}} {{gloss|of a gutter or hole}}. From early {{der|cs|gmh|bord}}, {{m|gmh|bort}} {{gloss|"side", especially of a ship; originally "a board", "a plank"}}. This comes from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*bʰerH-||cut}}.<ref name="Rejzek"/>

