Page 18282 olomoucké tvarůžky: Found match for regex: {
Page 18282 olomoucké tvarůžky: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=cs}}
[[File:Tvaruzky02.jpg|thumb|''olomoucké tvarůžky'']]

===Etymology===
The noun {{m|cs|tvarůžky}} is a plural form of {{m|cs|tvarůžek}}, which is a {{gloss|diminutive}} of {{m|cs|tvaroh||quark}}, which is an {{w|intermediate product}} of their manufacture. The adjective {{m|cs|olomoucké}} is a feminine nominative of {{m|cs|olomoucký||from Olomouc}} and refers to the fact that the cheese has been traditionally produced in the surroundings of the city of {{w|Olomouc}} and in the past used to be sold especially in Olomouc markets.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in-p|head=[[olomoucký|olomoucké]] [[tvarůžek|tvarůžky]]}}

# [[Olomouc cheese]] {{gloss|a kind of ripened soft cheese, characteristic with its strong scent, distinctive pungent taste and yellowish colour, nowadays made in the town of {{w|Loštice}}, the Czech Republic}}
#: {{syn|cs|homolky<q:obsolete>|;|olomoucké syrečky|;|syrečky|;|tvargle<q:informal>|;|tvarůžky}}
#* {{quote-journal|cs|author=|title=|journal=Sborník Československé akademie zemědělské|url=https://books.google.cz/books?hl=cs&id=eBvOAAAAMAAJ&dq=%22olomouck%C3%A9+tvar%C5%AF%C5%BEky%22|year=1931|volume=6|issue=|page=318|passage=Pověst praví, že když se císař Leopold II. v roce 1768 ženil s Marií Louisou španělskou, dovezli mu na svatbu Hanáci darem '''olomoucké tvarůžky'''.|translation=The legend goes that when emperor Leopold II married Maria Luisa of Spain, people from {{w|Haná}} brought him '''Olomouc cheese''' as a wedding gift.}}

====Usage notes====
In {{w|Moravia}} the term ''olomoucké tvarůžky'' or shortly {{m|cs|tvarůžky}} prevails, while in {{w|Bohemia}} they are usually called {{m|cs|olomoucké syrečky}} or shortly {{m|cs|syrečky}}.

The term is usually used only in the plural form ''olomoucké tvarůžky''. If the singular form {{m|cs|olomoucký tvarůžek}} occasionally occurs, it usually means "a piece of Olomouc cheese".

====Declension====
{{cs-ndecl|[[olomoucký|olomoucké]]<+> [[tvarůžek|tvarůžky]]<m.pl.locplích:ách>}}

====Related terms====
{{col-auto|cs|tvaroh|tvarohový|tvarůžek|tvarůžkový|tvarůžkárna}}

