Page 19497 jamkoviště: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{af|cs|jamkový|-iště}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɪʃcɛ|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|n}}

# {{lb|cs|golf}} [[green]]

====Usage notes====
Although this is the official term for the green, it is rarely used in practice. Instead, unofficial Czech versions of the English word ''green'', variously spelled ''green'', ''grýn'', and ''grín'', are used in practice.<ref>{{cite-web |title=Golf Club Hradec Králové, Jan. 6, 2010 |url=http://www.gchk.cz/literatura.php |accessdate=6 January 2010 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20100516193643/http://www.gchk.cz/literatura.php |archivedate=16 May 2010}}</ref>

