Page 20270 rozkulačení: Found match for regex: =
Page 20270 rozkulačení: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|cs|ru|раскула́чение}}. Morphologically from the passive participle {{m|cs|rozkulačen}} + inflectional suffix {{m|cs||-í}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|ɛɲiː|s=5}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|roz|ku|la|če|ní}}

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|n}}

# {{lb|cs|derogatory|historical|singulare tantum}} [[dekulakization]], finishing the process of deculacization {{gloss|the communist repression of wealthy peasants or farmers including [[collectivization]] of their property}} {{defdate|since 20th c.}}
#: {{syn|cs|dekulakizace}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1978 |author=Jiří Procházka |title=Hon na lišku |chapter=Vrah se skrývá v poli |page=82 |publisher=Československý spisovatel |location=Praha |url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=4VrnAAAAMAAJ&q=%22rozkula%C4%8Den%C3%AD%22 |isbn= |passage={{...}} nakonec přišel tvrdý úder do řad těch, co byli proti. Bezpečnost udělala přepadovou prohlídku u největšího sedláka ve vsi, Václava Zahradníka, a našla v jeho statku zatajené zásoby obilí, mouky, kůží, textilního a průmyslového zboží. Vypadalo to na '''rozkulačení''' a soud, než však k tomu mohlo dojít, starý Zahradník se oběsil ve stodole i se svou ženou.|translation={{...}} finally a hard blow against those opposing came. The police made a raid at the biggest farmer in the village, Václav Zahradník, and found secret reserves of grain, flour, leather, and textile and industrial goods in his farm. It seemed he is going to be a subject of '''dekulakization''', but before it could happen, the old Zahradník and his wife hanged themselves in the barn.}}

=====Usage notes=====
The English term {{m|en|dekulakization}} is equivalent to two slightly different Czech terms: {{m|cs|rozkulačování}}, which refers to the process of collectivizing the property of a farmer or farmers generally being in progress, or {{m|cs||rozkulačení}}, which refers to the finished process.

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|n.sg}}

=====Related terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|kulak}}

====Further reading====
* {{R:cs:KNLA}}

===Etymology 2===

====Adjective====
{{head|cs|adjective form}}

# {{inflection of|cs|rozkulačený||m|an|p|nom}}

====Noun====
{{head|cs|noun form}}

# {{inflection of|cs|rozkulačený||m|an|p|nom}}

