Page 21042 boroví: Found match for regex: =
Page 21042 boroví: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|cs|oviː|s=3}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|bo|ro|ví}}
* {{homophones|cs|borový}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{suffix|cs|bor|oví}}. The noun ''bor'' comes from {{der|cs|sla-pro|*borъ}}. Because in {{cog|sk|-}} and {{cog|pl|-}} dialects it means "marsh", it is sometimes connected with {{cog|sla-pro|*bara}}, meaning the same. More probably it is connected with {{der|cs|ine-pro|*bʰor-u-}}. Compare also {{m|cs|borůvka}}.<ref name="Rejzek"/>

====Noun====
{{cs-noun|n}} {{lb|cs|collective|singulare tantum}}

# [[pinewood]] {{gloss|forest consisting of pines}}
#: {{syn|cs|bor}}

=====Declension=====
{{cs-ndecl|n.sg}}

=====Related terms=====
{{col-auto|cs|borovice|borovička|borovicový|borový}}

===Etymology 2===
{{nonlemma}}

====Adjective====
{{head|cs|adjective form}}

# {{inflection of|cs|borový||an|m|nom//voc|p}}

===References===
<references>
<ref name="Rejzek">{{R:cs:Rejzek 2015|bor1|92–93}}</ref>
</references>

===Further reading===
* {{R:cs:PSJC}}
* {{R:cs:SSJC}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|cs|obrovi}}
* {{l|cs|robovi}}

