[[File:2012-08-29 Hydnum repandum L 256175 crop.jpg|thumbnail|lošák zprohýbaný<br/>(''[[Hydnum repandum]]'')]]
{{wikipedia|lišák zprohýbaný|lošák zprohýbaný|lang=cs}}
{{commonscat|Hydnum repandum}}
{{wikispecies|Hydnum repandum}}

===Etymology===
Noun {{m|cs|lošák||''hydnum''}} + adjective {{m|cs|zprohýbaný||distorted}}, which refers to the shape of the mushroom's fruiting body.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{cs-noun|m-in|g2=m-an}}

# ''[[Hydnum repandum]]'' {{gloss|species of [[fungi]] in the family {{taxlink|Hydnaceae|family|noshow=1}}}}
#: {{syn|cs|lišák zprohýbaný}}

====Usage notes====
* Although the word ''lošák'' should be declined as masculine inanimate, in practical colloquial usage the animate declension also sometimes appears.<ref name="Nase rec">{{R:cs:Nase rec|author=|title=Z našich časopisů|url=http://nase-rec.ujc.cas.cz/archiv.php?art=3951|year=1946|volume=30|issue=2–3}}</ref>
* The species ''Hydnum repandum'' was originally called ''lošák zprohýbaný'' ({{m|cs|lošák}} being the Czech name for {{taxlink|Hydnum|genus|ver=180317}}), but since the genus {{taxlink|Sarcodon|genus|ver=180317}} was split from the genus ''Hydnum'', many Czech mycologists have preferred calling the fungi of the genus ''Hydnum'' {{m|cs|lišák}}, reserving the name ''lošák'' for the fungi of the genus ''Sarcodon''.

====Declension====
''when inanimate:''
{{cs-ndecl|lošák<m> zprohýbaný<+>}}
''when animate:''
{{cs-ndecl|lošák<m.an> zprohýbaný<+>}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|species}} {{l|cs|houby}}&nbsp;– kingdom; {{l|cs|stopkovýtrusné}}&nbsp;– division; {{l|cs|rouškaté}}&nbsp;– class; {{l|cs|liškotvaré}}&nbsp;– order; {{l|cs|lišákovité}}&nbsp;– family; {{l|cs|lišák}}&nbsp;– genus

