# {{lb|cs|historical}} of a farmer or peasant: [[dekulakized]], having been the subject of forced [[collectivization]] and [[dekulakization]] {{defdate|since 20th c.}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1990 |author=Milan Jungmann |title=Průhledy do české prózy |chapter= |page=39 |publisher=Evropský kulturní klub |location=Praha |url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=wQ0HAQAAIAAJ&q=%22rozkula%C4%8Den%C3%A9ho%22 |isbn=80-85212-06-4 |passage=Dožívá jako dozorce v malé zoo truchlivý život '''rozkulačeného''' sedláka {{...}} |translation=As a guard in a small zoo he lives a sad end of life of a '''dekulakized''' farmer {{...}}}}
# {{lb|cs|historical}} of a property of a farmer or peasant: [[dekulakized]], [[collectivize]]d by force {{defdate|since 20th c.}}
#* {{quote-book|cs|year=1999 |author=Rio Preisner |authorlink=Rio Preisner |title=O životě a smrti konzervatismu |chapter= |page=10 |publisher= |location= |url=https://books.google.cz/books?id=i5cDAQAAMAAJ&q=%22rozkula%C4%8Den%C3%BDch%22 |isbn=80-7198-362-4 |passage=Jenže mužici dali přednost revoluci, která jim slibovala půdu z '''rozkulačených''' statků. |translation=However, poor peasants preferred revolution, which promised them land from '''dekulakized''' farms.}}

====Declension====
{{cs-adecl}}

===Noun===
